# cartworks

Cart for cartworks.

A quantity from the form is a string. It is valid only when the whole string is a base-10 whole number of 1 or more: "3" is valid, but "2kg", "3.5", "-1", "1e3" and "" are not and must be rejected, not coerced. parseQuantity returns the number or null.

## Per-line cap

A single cart line holds at most 99 units. withinLimit(qty) checks the cap; the caller rejects anything above it.
# Changelog

## 0.8.0

- Validate the quantity field.

## 0.7.0

- Cart line items.
